格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Nightly self-improvement for your DeepSeek Harness agent: harvest past sessions, replay recurring tasks, and consolidate validated skills behind a held-out gate. Brings microsoft/SkillOpt's SkillOpt-Sleep engine to dsh as native tools + a bundled skill (MIT).","id":"gh:1340063744","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-skillopt","slug":"WODE25500/dsh-skillopt","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin","self-improvement","skillopt"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Nightly self-improvement for your DeepSeek Harness agent: harvest past sessions, replay recurring ta"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"sks, and consolidate validated skills behind a held-out gate. Brings microsoft/SkillOpt's SkillOpt-S"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"leep engine to dsh as native tools + a bundled skill (MIT)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# SkillOpt-Sleep — DeepSeek Harness (dsh) integration"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Give your **DeepSeek Harness** agent a nightly **sleep cycle**: it reviews past\nsessions offline, re"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"plays your recurring tasks on your own API budget, and\nconsolidates what it learns into validated sk"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ills behind a held-out gate. Same\nengine as the Claude Code / Codex / Cursor integrations\n(skillopt_"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"sleep), wired into dsh's\nplugin system as native tools plus a bundled skill."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness is the \"everything is a plugin\" agent framework\n(deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness).\nPlu"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"gins are TypeScript modules exporting an `apply(ctx)` function that register\ncapabilities (tools, se"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rvices, events, settings) on the Cordis context."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Why a sleep cycle?"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Skills improve when an agent re-examines its own sessions — not just when you\nhand-tune a prompt. Th"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"e sleep cycle turns your everyday usage into a nightly,\nvalidation-gated skill-improvement loop: har"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"vest what you actually did, replay\nthe recurring tasks on your own API budget, and keep only the cha"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"nges that pass\na held-out gate. It's the same engine as the Claude Code / Codex / Cursor\nintegration"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"s, wired into dsh as native tools plus a bundled skill."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What this integration adds"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Component | Purpose |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| `src/index.js` | dsh plugin entry: registers 7 `skillopt_*` tools + Schemastery config |\n| `cordis"},{"id":"p9s2","text":".patch.yml` | bundle patch layer — drop `dsh-skillopt` into any profile's bundles |\n| `skills/skillo"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"pt-sleep/SKILL.md` | agent skill: when to use the tools, operating rules, data-boundary rules |\n| `s"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"cripts/sleep.py` | bootstrap/self-check runner (same command shape the tools use) |\n| `package.json`"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" | npm package metadata (bundle manifest) |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Tool | skillopt_sleep action | Behavior |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| `skillopt_status` | `status` | state, engine availability, latest staged proposal & report |\n| `sk"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"illopt_dry_run` | `dry-run` | full preview (harvest+mine+replay), stages nothing |\n| `skillopt_run` "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"| `run` | full cycle, stages a proposal (live files unchanged) |\n| `skillopt_adopt` | `adopt` | appl"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"y latest staged proposal (with backup) — the live-change boundary |\n| `skillopt_harvest` | `harvest`"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" | read-only show/export of mined tasks |\n| `skillopt_schedule` / `skillopt_unschedule` | `schedule`"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" / `unschedule` | install/remove the nightly cron entry |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Prerequisites"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (dsh) installed — dsh 0.1.x and 0.2.x are supported\n(`@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools` 0.1"},{"id":"p14s2","text":".1-rc.2, 0.2.0-rc.2)\n- Python 3.10+ with the SkillOpt-Sleep engine:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### As a bundle in a profile"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Add `dsh-skillopt` to the profile's bundles, or in the profile `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Local patch overlay (dev)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Run from a DeepSeek Harness **source checkout** (the official dev workflow,\n`pnpm` resolves the work"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ek Harness **source checkout** (the official dev workflow,\n`pnpm` resolves the workspace `dsh` bin):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"If `dsh` is installed **globally** (npm install -g), use it directly:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Either way the patch inserts the `skillopt` plugin row into the profile; then\nask the agent: \"Use sk"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"illopt_status to check the sleep cycle state.\""},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Config keys"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Key | Default | Purpose |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| `pythonCmd` | `python` | Python interpreter for the engine |\n| `module` | — (bootstrap) | engine P"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ython module override (`python -m <module>`) |\n| `engineScript` | — (scripts/sleep.py) | engine boot"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"strap script override |\n| `project` | — | default project directory |\n| `scope` | — | harvest scope:"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" `all` \\| `invoked` |\n| `backend` | — | `mock\\|claude\\|codex\\|copilot\\|cursor\\|pi\\|opencode\\|handoff"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"\\|azure_openai` |\n| `source` | — | `claude\\|codex\\|copilot\\|cursor\\|pi\\|opencode\\|auto` |\n| `model` "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"| — | backend model override |\n| `maxTasks` / `maxSessions` | — | mine/harvest caps |\n| `editBudget`"},{"id":"p28s7","text":" | — | bounded edits per cycle |\n| `preferences` | — | house rules for the reflection prior |\n| `jso"},{"id":"p28s8","text":"nOutput` | `false` | machine-readable JSON output |\n| `autoAdopt` | `false` | OPERATOR-ONLY: auto-ad"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"opt a passed proposal without asking |\n| `unscheduleAll` | `false` | OPERATOR-ONLY: allow `skillopt_"},{"id":"p28s10","text":"unschedule` to remove every managed entry |\n| `timeoutMs` | `600000` | per-call engine timeout in mi"},{"id":"p28s11","text":"to remove every managed entry |\n| `timeoutMs` | `600000` | per-call engine timeout in milliseconds |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Advanced engine keys (`gate_mode`, `gate_metric`, `gate_no_regression`,\n`dream_rollouts`, `recall_k`"},{"id":"p29s2","text":", `evolve_memory`/`evolve_skill`) go in\n`~/.skillopt-sleep/config.json` — the same file shared by al"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"y`/`evolve_skill`) go in\n`~/.skillopt-sleep/config.json` — the same file shared by all integrations."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Data boundary"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Harvest is read-only; `mock`/`handoff` make no network calls.\n- `run` stages proposals; `adopt` is"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" the normal live-change boundary and backs up first.\n- Real backends send truncated transcript excer"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"pts and derived tasks to the\nselected provider. For sensitive sessions, export tasks first (`skillop"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"t_harvest`\nwith `output=`), redact, set `\"reviewed\": true`, then replay — real backends\nrefuse unrev"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"iewed task files.\n- Outbound prompts are not guaranteed secret-free; review source & provider policy"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"ewed task files.\n- Outbound prompts are not guaranteed secret-free; review source & provider policy."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Validate (no API spend)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"See the SkillOpt-Sleep documentation for recorded\nresults, limitations, and the supported integratio"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"illOpt-Sleep documentation for recorded\nresults, limitations, and the supported integration surface."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
